Subject: Select original scrolling masked detail blending with bounded native streams
Upstream-base: 11c0bc65ad2ec21431c5d74f1ac4cbc1e3e2e2c3

Retain the original mask-weighted detail blend, four/five-stage lighting,
projected shadows, three independently scrolling UV sets and diffuse alpha preparation. Adapt packed vertex data to
bounded native float arrays and typed FIFO calls; reset registry state on
teardown and supply the explicit preview view. Console formats/FIFO remain.

